FerrionOS change to wasmtime-wasi 48.0.7 (Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception, kept), applied by the zed recipe's source script to the crate archive from crates.io:
- No O_DSYNC or O_RSYNC on this target: get_flags skips them (backported from commit c5b30cadc8472415107f5e4a86427afb2963aae0 of https://github.com/auronandace/wasmtime, branch redox-49), and compute_oflags approximates DSYNC with SYNC as on FreeBSD.

